abstract: >
  This repository collects the complete universal b-correction research program
  for the Navier-Stokes equations in one place: the analytical proof of global
  regularity of 3D NSE without artificial dissipation via the polarization
  correction b = 1/(4π+2√3) ≈ 0.0623812 (rotation angle θ_b = arcsin(b) ≈
  3.5765°), the full L1-L5 verification chain, the executed seven-open-problems
  program (P1-P7) with real JSON-protocol runs, a two-language monograph
  (RU/EN × DOCX/PDF), typeset papers with LaTeX sources, the KdV continuation
  chapter, and an eleven-language verification framework (Lean 4, Coq, Isabelle,
  Agda, C++, Rust, Haskell, Python, Julia and more).
